### Jira RAG Agent - REST Client scratchpad
### (install the "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request" above each block)

@host = http://localhost:8000

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Process an epic synchronously (returns results inline; may be slow)
POST {{host}}/process-epic-sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "epic_key": "PROJ-123"
}

### Process an epic in the background
POST {{host}}/process-epic
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "epic_key": "PROJ-123"
}

### Fetch cached results
GET {{host}}/results/PROJ-123

### Plain-text report
GET {{host}}/generate-report/PROJ-123

### Analyzer slices
GET {{host}}/analysis/PROJ-123

###
GET {{host}}/edge-cases/PROJ-123

###
GET {{host}}/regression/PROJ-123

###
GET {{host}}/bug-analysis/PROJ-123

###
GET {{host}}/insights/PROJ-123

###
GET {{host}}/recommendations/PROJ-123

###
GET {{host}}/action-plan/PROJ-123

### Comparator
POST {{host}}/compare-epics
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "epic_key_1": "PROJ-123",
    "epic_key_2": "PROJ-456"
}

### Free-form custom question
POST {{host}}/custom-analysis
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "epic_key": "PROJ-123",
    "custom_prompt": "Which tickets carry the highest data integrity risk and why?"
}

### Impact analysis for a set of proposed changes
POST {{host}}/impact-analysis
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "epic_key": "PROJ-123",
    "changes": [
        "Switch auth provider from Auth0 to Keycloak",
        "Migrate user table to UUID primary keys"
    ]
}
